  "Adam the Firstborn": {"id":"char_gloomrot_monster_vblood","lv":88,"vblood":true,"unit":"Human","desc":"The culmination of Doctor Henry Blackbrew’s brilliance, The Monster was to be the next step of human evolution, the ultimate machine of war. It is as powerful as Blackbrew could have ever desired but proved impossible to control. The Trancendum has done everything it can to contain The Monster, and they’ve been successful in doing so… for now.","stats":{"pp":106.9,"sp":106.9,"dr":0,"physRes":0,"spellRes":0,"fireRes":75},"abilities":["Primary Attack","Arctic Leap","Pierce Finnish","Throw","Chaos Barrier","Summon Lightning Pillars","Final Projectile","Eye of the Storm","Spectral Strike"],"drops":[["Exquisite Heart",1],["Soul Shard of the Monster",1],["Jewel",0.33],["Onyx Tear",0.25],["Flawless Amethyst",0.167],["Flawless Emerald",0.167],["Flawless Miststone",0.167],["Flawless Ruby",0.167],["Flawless Sapphire",0.167],["Flawless Topaz",0.167],["Ancestral Weapon",0.1]],"spawns":[[-1854,356]]},
  "Albert the Duke of Balaton": {"id":"char_cursed_toadking_vblood","lv":64,"vblood":true,"unit":"Beast","desc":"The patriarch of a family that once held land when these swamps were adequately inhabited. Over time, the cursed land twisted them, leaving this horrible, twisted toad that only remembers its lust for gold and jewels. It jealously guards its hoard of forgotten, worthless currency.","stats":{"pp":72.3,"sp":72.3,"dr":0,"physRes":0,"spellRes":0,"fireRes":0},"abilities":["Primary Attack","Arctic Leap","Poison Rain","Spit","Frog Vomit"],"drops":[["Unsullied Heart",0.8],["Jewel",0.35],["Ancestral Weapon",0.25],["Exquisite Heart",0.2],["Flawless Amethyst",0.042],["Flawless Emerald",0.042],["Flawless Miststone",0.042],["Flawless Ruby",0.042],["Flawless Sapphire",0.042],["Flawless Topaz",0.042]],"spawns":[[-925,265]]},
