  "Ben the Old Wanderer": {"id":"char_villager_cursedwanderer_vblood","lv":63,"vblood":true,"unit":"Human","desc":"This old survivalist sought to explore the Cursed Forest, despite knowing its dangers. As the curse began to cloud his mind, he found ways to fight against it. With his cloak and a helpful little wisp he’d captured in a lantern, his strange magical defense prevented the curse from taking full control. Though it was too late to prevent his mind from falling to tatters, he still does what he does best… survive.","stats":{"pp":70.9,"sp":70.9,"dr":0,"physRes":0,"spellRes":0,"fireRes":0},"abilities":["Primary Attack"],"drops":[["Unsullied Heart",0.8],["Jewel",0.35],["Ancestral Weapon",0.25],["Exquisite Heart",0.2],["Flawless Amethyst",0.042],["Flawless Emerald",0.042],["Flawless Miststone",0.042],["Flawless Ruby",0.042],["Flawless Sapphire",0.042],["Flawless Topaz",0.042]],"spawns":[[-864,55]]},
