  "Cyril the Cursed Smith": {"id":"char_undead_cursedsmith_vblood","lv":65,"vblood":true,"unit":"Human","desc":"Cursed with eternal life and servitude to the Cult of the Damned, Cyril has little desire to perform his duties. However, having been traded to the Cult before he had even been born, this tortured life is all he knows. Resigned to his fate, he does still take some small joy in inflicting his pain on others.","stats":{"pp":73.7,"sp":73.7,"dr":0,"physRes":0,"spellRes":0,"fireRes":0},"abilities":["Primary Attack","Arctic Leap","Spear Thrust","Frenzy","Multi Dash","Multi Dash Charge"],"drops":[["Unsullied Heart",0.8],["Jewel",0.35],["Ancestral Weapon",0.25],["Exquisite Heart",0.2],["Flawless Amethyst",0.042],["Flawless Emerald",0.042],["Flawless Miststone",0.042],["Flawless Ruby",0.042],["Flawless Sapphire",0.042],["Flawless Topaz",0.042]],"spawns":[[-754,108]]},
  "Dantos the Forgebinder": {"id":"char_blackfang_valyr_vblood","lv":82,"vblood":true,"unit":"Human","desc":"Dantos is a master of weapons, fascinated by both their construction and application. A true obsessive, his borderline inhuman dedication to his craft made him an excellent tool for his Queen, the great witch Megara. After a time, their monstrous similarities brought them closer, and Dantos became her personal strategist as well as a close confidant. Inspired by Megara’s secrets, it was Dantos who discovered that Venom Sap could be used to separate magical alloys, allowing the fusion of powerful artifacts into even greater weapons.","stats":{"pp":98,"sp":98,"dr":0,"physRes":0,"spellRes":0,"fireRes":0},"abilities":["Primary Attack","Phase Dual Tackle","Arctic Leap","Merciless Charge","Smack"],"drops":[["Unsullied Heart",0.8],["Jewel",0.741],["Exquisite Heart",0.2],["Ancestral Weapon",0.05],["Flawless Amethyst",0.042],["Flawless Emerald",0.042],["Flawless Miststone",0.042],["Flawless Ruby",0.042],["Flawless Sapphire",0.042],["Flawless Topaz",0.042],["Onyx Tear",0.037]],"spawns":[[-2359,248]]},
