  "Domina the Blade Dancer": {"id":"char_gloomrot_voltage_vblood","lv":60,"vblood":true,"unit":"Human","desc":"Originally an engineer responsible for advancements in practical electrical weapons, Domina’s incredible advancements were born of her hands-on, reckless approach to testing. Though this approach led to her demise, she was brought back to life by the maddening machinery of the infamous Doctor Henry Blackbrew. Domina’s sadism and masochism are unlimited, unmatched, and perhaps unstoppable in her pursuit of protecting and “policing” the people of Gloomrot.","stats":{"pp":66.9,"sp":66.9,"dr":0,"physRes":0,"spellRes":0,"fireRes":0},"abilities":["Primary Attack","Leap Attack","Electric Sprint","Electric Rod"],"drops":[["Unsullied Heart",0.8],["Jewel",0.35],["Ancestral Weapon",0.25],["Exquisite Heart",0.2],["Flawless Amethyst",0.042],["Flawless Emerald",0.042],["Flawless Miststone",0.042],["Flawless Ruby",0.042],["Flawless Sapphire",0.042],["Flawless Topaz",0.042]],"spawns":[[-1717,-153]]},
  "Dracula the Immortal King": {"id":"char_vampire_dracula_vblood","lv":91,"vblood":true,"unit":"PvEVampire","desc":"When Dracula fell centuries ago, it seemed like the Church of Luminance had done the impossible. The death of the Immortal King. However, in his final moments, Dracula enacted his final gambit and cast a cloud over Vardoran. The blood rain that followed would plant the seeds of Dracula’s will across the realm, twisting it, and filling it with his storied essence.\n\nAfter death, the Immortal King’s soul was cast out to where his otherworldly powers originated, the Shadow Realm. There he lingered, biding his time. Now the time has come. Dracula floods the world with his monstrous Legion of Noctum, having them gather the blood necessary for him to become whole once more and return to Vardoran.","stats":{"pp":111.4,"sp":111.4,"dr":0,"physRes":0,"spellRes":0,"fireRes":0},"abilities":["Shockwave","Primary Attack","Sword Throw","Spectral Leap","Arctic Leap","Dash Right","Dash Left","Blood Bolt Swarm","Ring Of Blood","Blood Shower","Spectral Strike","Veil of Blood","Etherial Sword"],"drops":[["Soul Shard of Dracula",1]],"spawns":[[-78,-586]]},
