  "Gorecrusher the Behemoth": {"id":"char_cursed_mountainbeast_vblood","lv":84,"vblood":true,"unit":"Beast","desc":"Once a loyal warrior in the Legion of Noctum. So dedicated was his fanaticism that upon Dracula’s death to the hands of the Church of Luminance, the warrior severed his shield-bearing arm in an act of shame. In a delirious haze, he wandered into the wilderness of the Cursed Forest expecting to die. The corruption within gave him not death, however, but something much worse.","stats":{"pp":100.9,"sp":100.9,"dr":0,"physRes":0,"spellRes":0,"fireRes":0},"abilities":["Primary Attack","Arctic Leap","Dash Attack","Secondary Attack"],"drops":[["Unsullied Heart",0.8],["Jewel",0.741],["Exquisite Heart",0.2],["Ancestral Weapon",0.05],["Flawless Amethyst",0.042],["Flawless Emerald",0.042],["Flawless Miststone",0.042],["Flawless Ruby",0.042],["Flawless Sapphire",0.042],["Flawless Topaz",0.042],["Onyx Tear",0.037]],"spawns":[[-628,17]]},
