  "Jade the Vampire Hunter": {"id":"char_vhunter_jade_vblood","lv":57,"vblood":true,"unit":"Human","desc":"A huntress from a noble house in Brighthaven, famous for their development of new-age weaponry that rivals even the genius of the scientists of Gloomrot. After the disappearance of her brother, rumor has it the expert marksman stole an impressive arsenal of experimental weapons to aid in her hunting down the culprit.","stats":{"pp":63,"sp":63,"dr":0,"physRes":0,"spellRes":0,"fireRes":0},"abilities":["Revolvers","Snipe","Caltrops","Disabling Shot","Blast Vault","Stealth","Explosive Shells"],"drops":[["Unsullied Heart",0.8],["Jewel",0.35],["Ancestral Weapon",0.25],["Exquisite Heart",0.2],["Vampire Hunter Headgear",0.075],["Flawless Amethyst",0.042],["Flawless Emerald",0.042],["Flawless Miststone",0.042],["Flawless Ruby",0.042],["Flawless Sapphire",0.042],["Flawless Topaz",0.042]],"spawns":[[-1497,-779]]},
  "Jakira the Shadow Huntress": {"id":"char_blackfang_livith_vblood","lv":75,"vblood":true,"unit":"Human","desc":"Jakira was not always a member of the Venom Blades. Like many, she first resisted their onslaught, standing against the great witch Megara and her raiders as they descended upon her homeland and consumed its forests. A master duelist, Jakira always believed in strength, and now she serves the strong with unflinching loyalty. Like many Venom Blades, she’s mixed her skills with their corrupted magic, alchemy, and brutal techniques, always looking for new ways to prove herself and earn her place at her masters' side. Despite her stealthy nature, this cocky huntress always warns her prey just before she strikes.","stats":{"pp":87.7,"sp":87.7,"dr":0,"physRes":0,"spellRes":0,"fireRes":0},"abilities":["Primary Attack","Slicing Dash","Arctic Leap","Dash","Spirit Orbs","Shadow Dance"],"drops":[["Exquisite Heart",1],["Jewel",0.35],["Gold Jewelry",0.273],["Ancestral Weapon",0.25],["Flawless Amethyst",0.167],["Flawless Emerald",0.167],["Flawless Miststone",0.167],["Flawless Ruby",0.167],["Flawless Sapphire",0.167],["Flawless Topaz",0.167]],"spawns":[[-2141,-267]]},
  "Keely the Frost Archer": {"id":"char_bandit_frostarrow_vblood","lv":20,"vblood":true,"unit":"Human","desc":"A cold-hearted bandit lieutenant, she oversees the animal husbandry and leather tanning camp in Farbane. Once a member of the Dunley militia, she was removed from her position for her brutal battlefield decision-making. Aside from being a crack shot, her enchanted arrows rain down icy death.","stats":{"pp":24.4,"sp":24.4,"dr":0,"physRes":0,"spellRes":0,"fireRes":0},"abilities":["Multi Shot","Camouflage","Dash","Rain Of Arrows"],"drops":[["Unsullied Heart",0.25],["Crude Amethyst",0.033],["Crude Emerald",0.033],["Crude Miststone",0.033],["Crude Ruby",0.033],["Crude Sapphire",0.033],["Crude Topaz",0.033]],"spawns":[[-1034,-1356]]},
