  "Kodia the Ferocious Bear": {"id":"char_forest_bear_dire_vblood","lv":35,"vblood":true,"unit":"Beast","desc":"This mother bear is said to be ancient. Rumor has it that she wears a scar from every Bandit King that has ever lived, a rite of passage for the position. Her life stands as testament to the fact that no bandit leader has ever done well enough to finish the job.","stats":{"pp":37.5,"sp":37.5,"dr":0,"physRes":0,"spellRes":0,"fireRes":0},"abilities":["Primary Attack","Dash"],"drops":[["Rugged Hide",1],["Bone",1],["Unsullied Heart",0.25]],"spawns":[[-717,-1513]]},
  "Kriig the Undead General": {"id":"char_undead_leader_vblood","lv":47,"vblood":true,"unit":"Human","desc":"A truly impressive strategic mind in life, Kriig saw an early end for his mistaken faith in his allies. Though he was sent to an unjust grave, he was like any great mastermind, and had contingencies in place for just such an occasion. A dark deal with an entity of undeath allowed him to rise again and take his revenge. Now he serves the Cult of the Damned with renewed purpose, fully immersing himself into their enigmatic cause.","stats":{"pp":50.6,"sp":50.6,"dr":0,"physRes":0,"spellRes":0,"fireRes":0},"abilities":["Primary Attack","Chain Hook Projectile","Arctic Leap","Ward of the Damned"],"drops":[["Unsullied Heart",1],["Jewel",0.35],["Regular Amethyst",0.042],["Regular Emerald",0.042],["Regular Miststone",0.042],["Regular Ruby",0.042],["Regular Sapphire",0.042],["Regular Topaz",0.042]],"spawns":[[-1403,-925]]},
  "Leandra the Shadow Priestess": {"id":"char_undead_bishopofshadows_vblood","lv":47,"vblood":true,"unit":"Human","desc":"There are few creatures on the face of Vardoran as ancient as Leandra. Mysterious and surrounded with shadow magic and undeath, it is said that when Dracula fell, and the poisonous blood rains soaked Vardoran, she stood willingly in the deadly downpour. Some say she embraced the dark power of that corruption and made it her own. Today she serves as High Priestess of the Cult of the Damned.","stats":{"pp":50.6,"sp":50.6,"dr":0,"physRes":0,"spellRes":0,"fireRes":0},"abilities":["Projectile","Bolt","Mist Walk","Shadow Soldier"],"drops":[["Unsullied Heart",1],["Jewel",0.35],["Regular Amethyst",0.042],["Regular Emerald",0.042],["Regular Miststone",0.042],["Regular Ruby",0.042],["Regular Sapphire",0.042],["Regular Topaz",0.042]],"spawns":[[-1182,-389]]},
