  "Matka the Curse Weaver": {"id":"char_cursed_witch_vblood","lv":76,"vblood":true,"unit":"Human","desc":"Some say Matka is the oldest of the witches, but the truth is that nobody knows how or when these timeless creatures were born. A force of nature and a mockery of humanity, she is utterly beyond reason.","stats":{"pp":89.2,"sp":89.2,"dr":0,"physRes":0,"spellRes":0,"fireRes":0},"abilities":["Bolt","Primary Attack","Shriek","Exploding Mushrooms","Corrupted Ghouls","Explode Mosquito","Death Squad"],"drops":[["Exquisite Heart",1],["Jewel",0.35],["Gold Jewelry",0.273],["Ancestral Weapon",0.25],["Flawless Amethyst",0.167],["Flawless Emerald",0.167],["Flawless Miststone",0.167],["Flawless Ruby",0.167],["Flawless Sapphire",0.167],["Flawless Topaz",0.167]],"spawns":[[-684,99]]},
  "Megara the Serpent Queen": {"id":"char_blackfang_morgana_vblood","lv":88,"vblood":true,"unit":"Beast","desc":"There was once a small village of warriors, a place of little significance. When the great witch Megara appeared the villagers reacted with suspicion, gathering their forces to stand against her. Megara gave them a display of power that inspired such terror it crushed all hope of resistance, driving them to their knees.\n\n“I am your Queen! The greatest half of you will become my first subjects, and will walk by my side. Come dusk, each of you that are holding the heart of one of your neighbors will earn your place.”\n\nThose who obeyed became the first Venom Blades, worthy of receiving the secret of Venom Sap. This fuels their war effort, but more importantly, the great witch herself.","stats":{"pp":106.9,"sp":106.9,"dr":0,"physRes":0,"spellRes":0,"fireRes":0},"abilities":["Primary Attack","Spectral Blast","Spectral Swarm","Summon Tail","Spectral Hell","Spectral Orb Barrage","Rings Of Terror","Transformation","Corruption Fountain","Spectral Snake","Traveling Orb Barrage","Spectral Strike","Mist Spinners"],"drops":[["Exquisite Heart",1],["Soul Shard of the Serpent",1],["Jewel",0.33],["Onyx Tear",0.25],["Flawless Amethyst",0.167],["Flawless Emerald",0.167],["Flawless Miststone",0.167],["Flawless Ruby",0.167],["Flawless Sapphire",0.167],["Flawless Topaz",0.167],["Ancestral Weapon",0.1]],"spawns":[[-2170,287]]},
