  "Morian the Stormwing Matriarch": {"id":"char_harpy_matriarch_vblood","lv":70,"vblood":true,"unit":"Beast","desc":"The most dangerous of her kind, and fiercely protective of her tribe. It’s said that the harpies are attracted to only the finest gemstones, and none has a sharper eye for quality than the matriarch herself. Wealthy folk are warned to keep their jewels out of sight if they dare travel outside the protection of Brighthaven.","stats":{"pp":80.6,"sp":80.6,"dr":0,"physRes":0,"spellRes":0,"fireRes":0},"abilities":["Primary Attack","Dash","Projectile","AoE"],"drops":[["Exquisite Heart",1],["Jewel",0.35],["Gold Jewelry",0.273],["Ancestral Weapon",0.25],["Flawless Amethyst",0.167],["Flawless Emerald",0.167],["Flawless Miststone",0.167],["Flawless Ruby",0.167],["Flawless Sapphire",0.167],["Flawless Topaz",0.167]],"spawns":[[-2169,-911]]},
