  "Simon Belmont the Vampire Hunter": {"id":"char_vhunter_castleman","lv":80,"vblood":true,"unit":"Human","desc":"This mysterious Vampire hunter has arrived from lands unknown on a fervent mission to cut down anything that they might deem a threat to mankind. Monster and Vampire alike will find themselves the target of this stranger’s ire, and even worse, on the wrong end of the exotic stranger’s unique battle whip… an intriguing new tool of war.","stats":{"pp":95,"sp":95,"dr":0,"physRes":0,"spellRes":0,"fireRes":70},"abilities":["Primary Attack","Lasting Holy Water","Spin Shield","Knockback Whip Fire","Spinning Cross","Axe Throw","Spectral Strike","Tackle","Throw","Dagger Projectile","Dash","Dagger Throw","Knockback Whip","Holy Beam"],"drops":[["Unsullied Heart",0.8],["Jewel",0.741],["Exquisite Heart",0.2],["Vampire Hunter Headgear",0.075],["Ancestral Weapon",0.05],["Flawless Amethyst",0.042],["Flawless Emerald",0.042],["Flawless Miststone",0.042],["Flawless Ruby",0.042],["Flawless Sapphire",0.042],["Flawless Topaz",0.042],["Onyx Tear",0.037]],"spawns":[[-1238,-981]]},
  "Sir Erwin the Gallant Cavalier": {"id":"char_militia_fabian_vblood","lv":46,"vblood":true,"unit":"Human","desc":"Sir Erwin is an expert horseman, known both for his skill on horseback and unbearable company at formal events. Being generally disliked by his superiors but too skilled and devoted to the Light to exile to Farbane, he was instead sent to prepare for a grand offensive against the Cult of the Damned. Atop his fearless steed, Charger, he trains at the Dunley Horse Track, waiting for his promised troops. Surely, they’ll arrive any day now.","stats":{"pp":49.4,"sp":49.4,"dr":0,"physRes":0,"spellRes":0,"fireRes":0},"abilities":["Primary Attack","Call Lightning","Lightning Orb"],"drops":[["Unsullied Heart",1],["Jewel",0.35],["Regular Amethyst",0.042],["Regular Emerald",0.042],["Regular Miststone",0.042],["Regular Ruby",0.042],["Regular Sapphire",0.042],["Regular Topaz",0.042]],"spawns":[[-1820,-877]]},
  "Sir Magnus the Overseer": {"id":"char_churchoflight_overseer_vblood","lv":66,"vblood":true,"unit":"Human","desc":"A fanatical servant of the Church of Luminance, his blind faith in the Light makes him the perfect candidate for Overseer of the Silver Mines. He is willing to look past the vile actions of the church, and even enforce them if it’s in the interest of what he believes is the greater good. Even if it means doing something he might never condone, such as forced labor, or exiling his beloved daughter.","stats":{"pp":75,"sp":75,"dr":0,"physRes":0,"spellRes":0,"fireRes":0},"abilities":["Primary Attack","Secondary Attack","Merciless Charge","Piercing Charge Throw","Reinforcement","Snow Lob"],"drops":[["Exquisite Heart",1],["Jewel",0.35],["Gold Jewelry",0.273],["Ancestral Weapon",0.25],["Flawless Amethyst",0.167],["Flawless Emerald",0.167],["Flawless Miststone",0.167],["Flawless Ruby",0.167],["Flawless Sapphire",0.167],["Flawless Topaz",0.167]],"spawns":[[-2333,-592]]},
