  "Solarus the Immaculate": {"id":"char_churchoflight_paladin_vblood","lv":86,"vblood":true,"unit":"Human","desc":"A legendary paladin of the Light and the oldest living member of the Church of Luminance. He has watched firsthand the descent of mankind with disinterest. A pioneer from the age of heroes, he remembers the struggle of facing down Dracula’s armies until all hope was lost. He remembers finding the light... He remembers the satisfaction of lifting his holy blade to the Immortal King, and striking down the greatest evil the world has ever seen.\n\nHe yearns to return to the days where he knew glory.","stats":{"pp":103.9,"sp":103.9,"dr":0,"physRes":0,"spellRes":0,"fireRes":0},"abilities":["Primary Attack","Dash","Holy Bubble Beam","Angelic Ascent","Holy Spinners","Holy Flack Cannon","Heal Angel","Divine Rays"],"drops":[["Exquisite Heart",1],["Soul Shard of Solarus",1],["Jewel",0.33],["Onyx Tear",0.25],["Flawless Amethyst",0.167],["Flawless Emerald",0.167],["Flawless Miststone",0.167],["Flawless Ruby",0.167],["Flawless Sapphire",0.167],["Flawless Topaz",0.167],["Ancestral Weapon",0.1]],"spawns":[[-1961,-717]]},
  "Stavros the Carver": {"id":"char_blackfang_carverboss_vblood","lv":75,"vblood":true,"unit":"Human","desc":"One would not expect a simple craftsman to be so vicious in battle, but none represent the Venom Blades’ endless thirst for havoc and consumption better than Stavros. From carving the trees with runes of corruption to harvesting the Venom Sap those trees produce, he works with a cold glee. Whether it be bark or flesh, every cut of his knife is a show of his devotion to the great witch Megara. Like any Venom Blade, he loves and fears his queen in equal measure, revering her as a goddess and looking to her for higher purpose.","stats":{"pp":87.7,"sp":87.7,"dr":0,"physRes":0,"spellRes":0,"fireRes":0},"abilities":["Primary Attack","Body Slam","Coat Weapon","Spew Corruption","Summon Carvers","Weapon Throw"],"drops":[["Exquisite Heart",1],["Jewel",0.35],["Gold Jewelry",0.273],["Ancestral Weapon",0.25],["Flawless Amethyst",0.167],["Flawless Emerald",0.167],["Flawless Miststone",0.167],["Flawless Ruby",0.167],["Flawless Sapphire",0.167],["Flawless Topaz",0.167]],"spawns":[[-2505,-75]]},
