  "Talzur the Winged Horror": {"id":"char_manticore_vblood","lv":86,"vblood":true,"unit":"Beast","desc":"A creature that was once one of Dracula’s favorite pets. The monster mourned the death of its master in a blood-soaked vigil, enduring the toxic, bloody rains that followed Dracula’s death for seven days and seven nights. Unlike the many creatures that suffered under the rains, this one embraced the agony. Through its love and devotion for the tyrant king, it was able to embrace all of the hatred passed down through the downpour’s curse and become The Winged Horror.","stats":{"pp":103.9,"sp":103.9,"dr":0,"physRes":0,"spellRes":0,"fireRes":0},"abilities":["Chaos Breath","Frost Breath","Wing Storm","Dash","Air Dash","Breath From Above","Frost Vortex","Primary Attack","Stagger"],"drops":[["Exquisite Heart",1],["Soul Shard of the Winged Horror",1],["Jewel",0.33],["Onyx Tear",0.25],["Flawless Amethyst",0.167],["Flawless Emerald",0.167],["Flawless Miststone",0.167],["Flawless Ruby",0.167],["Flawless Sapphire",0.167],["Flawless Topaz",0.167],["Ancestral Weapon",0.1]],"spawns":[[-681,-1336]]},
